  m_Name: BeforeTutor3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Honestly\u2026 it\u2019s not that bad here."
  - What do you mean?
  - "Well\u2026 the job is three times more dangerous, but there\u2019s twice as
    little of it. Free housing, food. Private rooms instead of shared ones, a gym,
    a couch."
  - "Everyone even has their own bathroom\u2026"
  - "Though I\u2019m guessing that\u2019s because of how much blood we usually have
    to wash off, and not everything comes out in the laundry\u2026"
  - "Correct. And speaking of the gym\u2014I think you should actually go there sometime."
  - "You look like you can\u2019t handle the weight of a rifle. Tall and thin like
    a\u2026 noodle."
  - "Oh, totally. And the biggest downside so far is definitely the terrible soundproofing,
    because \u201Cspeaking of noodles,\u201D"
  - "for some reason I\u2019ve been hearing some weepy, sniffly little sobs through
    the wall these two days."
  - " Like someone\u2019s crying at night. By the way\u2026 that\u2019s not you,
    is it, neighbor?"
  - "No idea what you\u2019re talking about. Goodbye."
